Roles and Responsibilities
Provide technical and administrative support to the company’s environmental consultants;
Provide competence in environmental reporting, health and safety documentation and similar studies.
Preparing and processing of documents, records and information as received or presented by the company;
Assist in company services, procedures, activities and general strategy in achieving its goals and objectives at every given period;
