Key Responsibilities
Leads management, oversight and monitoring of all aspects of program/M&E activities taken on by the LFA;
Provides expert advice, critical and analytical thinking in the areas of program management and monitoring to the Global Fund Country Team,
Provides coaching, direction and supervision to the junior experts
